      "paused_activity": "A QA-only WH_GETMESSAGE hook, loaded from an external DLL, counted main-window messages removed from the UI thread queue for 1.5 seconds while Browse Boards was open. No hook or instrumentation was added to the delivered game. This measures redundant timer/paint work, not CPU percentage.",
