      "cursor": "The XFixes server cursor image and hotspot were captured. The real cursor was composited at its hotspot over the simultaneous root-window screenshot because normal screenshots omit it. The image was visually inspected. The arrow reference was taken from the original application menu; its entire old client, including the HUD, used a cross.",
